{
  "name": "Blood Curse of Corrosion",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you deal acid damage equal to three rolls of your hemocraft die to a creature you can see within 30 feet of you. The target then has to make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failure, attack rolls against the target have Advantage until the end of your next turn. On a success, only the first attack roll has Advantage.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> Every time the target takes damage while under this curse's effect, it takes additional acid damage equal to one roll of your hemocraft die.</p>",
